      text: "Fraternal correction properly so called is an act of charity, even as the curing of a sick brother's body belongs to charity. And since charity bids us seek the good of our neighbour, and is not content with the appearance thereof, it follows that to correct a brother is an act of charity, in so far as we wish to drive out his evil.",
